// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | ADR-006
=adr: 006
=title: Clean Layered Architecture
=date: 2026-02-10
=status: accepted

#ctx
~need: separation of concerns for maintainability and testability
~requirement: swappable data layer, isolated business logic

#opts
~alt1: MVC (rejected: HTTP concerns leak into models)
~alt2: feature-based (rejected: cross-feature dependencies harder to manage)

#decision
=chosen: Controllers → Services → Models (3-layer)
=controllers: 14 files → HTTP handling, validation, error formatting
=services: 22 files → business logic, transactions, no HTTP concerns
=models: 18 files → Mongoose schemas, data access, queries
!services: must_not_import_Fastify_request_reply

#consequences
+pos: [clear_boundaries, HTTP_agnostic_logic, services_testable_without_Fastify, swappable_persistence, easy_onboarding]
-neg: [3_files_per_feature, indirection, potential_over-engineering_for_CRUD]

#scope
=arch_summary_update: yes
